Island Walk Publix minutes later. Deputies say he told them he'd planned to bring the meat to his girlfriend's house, but when he got there and found her cooking with another man, he dumped the whole haul instead. Alvarez Reyna was booked on felony retail theft charges and held on a $5,000 bond, plus an ICE detainer."}],"$L16","$L17"]}],"$L18","$L19"]}]]}]
